From: "nacho.d.g" <iduartgomez@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Mar 2026 20:36:37 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 39/69] feat(ui): mobile responsive layout with CSS clamp +
 view switching (#144)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

* feat(ui): add mobile responsive layout with CSS clamp + view switching

Re-implements mobile responsive layout (previously reverted in PR #142)
using an iframe-safe approach per issue #143.

Layer 1 - CSS clamp() for graceful shrinking:
- Tablet (768-1024px): sidebar widths shrink via clamp()
- Mobile (<768px): scaled font sizes, compact message padding
- Small screens (<600px): compact emoji picker, wrapped inputs

Layer 2 - View switching for mobile (<768px):
- MobileView signal (Rooms/Chat/Members) with Chat as default
- Conditional CSS classes: hidden/md:flex (desktop always wins)
- Hamburger + members nav buttons in chat header (md:hidden)
- Back arrows in room list and members panel
- Room click auto-switches to chat view

Key design: all mobile rules scoped behind @media queries or md:hidden/
hidden md:flex Tailwind classes. Desktop layout (>=768px) is completely
unchanged — md:flex always overrides hidden regardless of signal state.

Also adds Playwright test suite (ui/tests/) covering:
- Desktop 1280px: 3-column layout verification
- Tablet 768px: narrower sidebars, all panels visible
- Mobile 480px: view switching, hamburger nav, members nav
- Mobile 320px: no overflow, readable content
- Desktop recovery after mobile resize
- iframe embedding (the PR #142 failure mode)

* docs: add mobile responsive layout screenshots for PR review

* ci: add Playwright UI tests to build workflow

Adds a ui-playwright-tests job that runs after the main build:
- Starts dx serve with example-data,no-sync
- Runs 11 Playwright tests covering responsive layout at
  1280px, 768px, 480px, and 320px viewports
- Tests view switching, navigation, iframe embedding
- Uploads test-results artifact on failure

* fix(ci): increase Playwright timeouts and improve server readiness check

The first CI run had navigation timeouts because the dev server wasn't
fully ready. Increase timeouts (30s nav, 60s test, 2 retries) and
improve the readiness check to wait for WASM content.

* fix(ui): improve Playwright tests and fix Tailwind v4 content scanning

- Add @source directive to tailwind.css so Tailwind v4 scans .rs files
  for class names (md:flex, md:hidden, etc. were not being generated)
- Fix iframe test: use sandbox attributes matching Freenet gateway
- Add 767px breakpoint boundary test
- Replace all waitForTimeout with proper Playwright assertions
- Add Firefox and WebKit browser projects to playwright.config.ts
- Add mobile-chrome and mobile-safari device projects
- Scope !important CSS overrides to .app-root to avoid global impact
- Remove duplicate chat-messages CSS rule from main.css
- Remove committed screenshot PNGs (belong in PR description, not repo)
- Fix CI workflow: remove unnecessary needs:[build], add server failure detection
- Add cargo make tasks: test-ui-playwright, test-ui-playwright-setup

All 65 tests pass across 5 browser configurations.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>

